# Gaming stack from the configured CachyOS/Arch repositories and Bun OS repo.
# Upstream first: CachyOS ships the gaming composition as two meta packages
# (cachyos-gaming-meta: proton-cachyos-slr, wine-cachyos-opt, umu-launcher, winetricks,
# protontricks, 32-bit audio/video libs; cachyos-gaming-applications: steam, gamescope,
# mangohud, lutris, heroic-games-launcher, goverlay, faugus-launcher). Everything below is
# verified present with `pacman -Si` against cachyos + core/extra/multilib (see
# docs/bun-os/ABSORBED-UPSTREAM.md). Packages that exist only in the AUR (steamcmd,
# proton-ge-custom-bin, dxvk-bin, vkd3d-proton-bin, logiops) are not listed: the image
# build refuses missing packages and AUR is not a source owner. DXVK and vkd3d-proton
# ship inside Proton.
cachyos-gaming-meta
cachyos-gaming-applications
steam
steam-devices
proton-cachyos-slr
wine-cachyos-opt
winetricks
mesa
lib32-mesa
vulkan-icd-loader
lib32-vulkan-icd-loader
vulkan-radeon
lib32-vulkan-radeon
vulkan-intel
lib32-vulkan-intel
vulkan-tools
bunos-gamescope
lib32-gamescope
gamemode
lib32-gamemode
mangohud
lib32-mangohud
lutris
heroic-games-launcher
umu-launcher
# NVIDIA userspace (kernel modules only in the bootable target)
nvidia-utils
lib32-nvidia-utils
nvidia-settings
# nvidia-container-toolkit: its CDI refresh unit fails on hosts without an NVIDIA GPU (seen at first boot); install it per host.
# Logitech
solaar
piper
libratbag
# ASUS
asusctl
# supergfxctl is only in the Omarchy repo; add it to the disk image list, not here.
rog-control-center
# Bazzite recipes that map to pacman packages (ujust: waydroid, distrobox, sunshine)
waydroid
distrobox
sunshine
flatpak
